Date: 2026-09-02.  Captures: cslh19, Phi_System_Base REPL heap, both dumps
produced by `Ledger_Dump.thy` (importing `PhiEx_All`) via `ledger_dump.py`;
comparison by `compare_dumps.py` (this directory).

This is the FINAL pair, taken after the implementation review's approved
fixes landed (M4, m7, m8, R2-R5): `ledger_dump.pre.txt` on the clean tree
(production Debt_Axiom, right after the baseline corpus run,
`corpus_run_baseline.out.txt`); then the two patched files rsynced
(md5-verified on both ends: Debt_Axiom.ML 413e90a2..., Debt_Axiom_Doc.thy
6cc92629...; `git status -- Debt_Axiom/` on cslh19 shows exactly these two
modified); REPL restarted by `hard_restart.sh`, whose corpus run is the
